	10 data 0, 35.535000, 35.029000, 35.869000, 35.113000, 35.744000, 35.941000, 35.283000, 36.836000, 36.021000, 36.087000, 36.605000, 36.602000, 36.899000, 37.271000, 37.651000, 38.095000, 38.312000, 38.988000, 
